OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFailed asylum seekers face removal
OL,4,Awithout five-day notice period
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move was criticised by the Refugee
OL,7,FCouncil which said: "Removing people at
OL,8,Fsuch short notice will cause
OL,9,Funnecessary distress and anxiety to
OL,10,Fpeople."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
