OL,3,ANvidia dismisses 'Bring Jensen Back'
OL,4,Acampaign as Trump backs effort to
OL,5,Areinstate ex CEO
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia has dismissed a campaign calling
OL,8,Ffor the company's co-founder Jensen
OL,9,FHuang to be handed back his job as
OL,10,Fallies, including US President Donald
OL,11,FTrump, supported the effort.
OL,13,FTrump said on Monday that he "would
OL,14,Fcertainly not mind" if Huang was
OL,15,Freinstated, joining a list of
OL,16,Fsupporters including SpaceX's Elon Musk
OL,17,Fwho are backing a "Bring Jensen Back"
OL,18,Fcampaign.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
